<title>SWEDEN: H&amp;M to start operations in France H1 '98.</title>
<headline>H&amp;M to start operations in France H1 '98.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish fashion retailer Hennes &amp; Mauritz said on Wednesday it would start operations in France in the first half of 1998.  </p>
<p>H&amp;M, a high street retailer which has over 450 stores across Europe, said it had signed a lease on a property in Rue de Rivoli in Paris.</p>
<p>&quot;Negotiations are continuing for a number of other shops in France,&quot; H&amp;M said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Belinda Goldsmith, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1045</p>
</text>
